	"data": "<!-- scanner: tagged active/ongoing but not updated in 78d — review -->\n\nConcept: ECS × Linked Data Architecture\n\nThe Key Insight\n\nECS and Linked Data are the same data model at different speeds.\nJSON-LD = serialized, queryable, shareable, persistent\nECS = in-memory, iterable, renderable, fast\n\nThe @context IS the component registry. One vocabulary, two access patterns. Swap runtime implementations freely — the predicates don't change, the store doesn't change, the API doesn't change.\n\nThe…",
